{"name":"Malta","slug":"malta","code":"MT","continent":"Europe","hero":"plonkit/malta/malta.webp","updated":"2025-12-07T11:52:48.280Z","sections":[{"title":"Identifying Malta","title_zh":"辨識馬爾他","items":[{"id":"vABj","text":["Malta drives on the **left**.","NOTE: Cyprus also drives on the left."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/malta/mt_drivingside.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/rfZ8SAafi1SBttnA9","clues":["driving_side"],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"0i5u","text":["Like most of Europe, Maltese licence plates have a blue strip on the left. However, unlike most of Europe, **short plates** are very common."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/malta/mt_licenceplate.webp","link":"","clues":["license_plates"],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"ZuPI","text":["The general landscape of Malta consists of slightly hilly **dry agricultural fields**. Many roads are also only 1 or 2 lanes wide, due to the island’s size. Having a mediterranean climate, [cacti](https://maps.app.goo.gl/Kh2pMFPUTQhivKT76#extra%5Btags%5D=yes) and various [dry shrubs](https://maps.app.goo.gl/BqgdrBxdG2UFft3z7#extra%5Btags%5D=yes) can be seen."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/malta/mt_landscape.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/T3QxnVYSJTAy2HE36","clues":["nature","scenery"],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"A85X","text":["**Limestone rock walls** are extremely common in Malta. This alone is usually enough to determine that you are in Malta."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/malta/mt_rockwall.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/my8PqqA57SB2pbDc6#extra%5Btags%5D=yes","clues":[],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"4s8H","text":["The vast majority of buildings in Malta consist of low storey buildings, with **white to beige** coloured walls. Buildings made of [limestone](https://maps.app.goo.gl/BMSfQdQ7rujtEErg8#extra%5Btags%5D=yes) are also fairly common."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/malta/mt_architecture.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/e19YM7JpiyDN11a89","clues":["architecture"],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"xVAC","text":["This style of traditional **covered balconies** is very common on Maltese buildings. They are often painted in bright colours."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/malta/mt_balconies.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/yUJShYjxa1mhUeWN6","clues":["architecture"],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"CkGF","text":["The Maltese word for street is “**triq**”, which can be seen on almost every street sign."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/malta/mt_triq.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/MEuWmXYJ3izUoE2v5","clues":["street_names","signs"],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"v6Vj","text":["**Bus stops** are a common sight in Malta. They may sometimes have useful information as to where you are."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/malta/mt_busstop.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/i7LEyjPaARkUwj2x5","clues":["bus_stops"],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"S9ac","text":["Like the UK and Ireland, Malta uses these distinctive **double yellow no parking lines**."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/malta/mt_doubleyellowline.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/FARDjAGrHppMShPQ7","clues":[],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"eHEp","text":["**English** is the primary language of Malta."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/malta/mt_english.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/Dmr5UrfEJtx7krTx6#extra%5Btags%5D=eng","clues":["language"],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"XUts","text":["Apart from English it is also common to see the **Maltese** language. Maltese uses the Latin script, but with unique letters, which include:","- Ċ ċ","- Ġ ġ","- Ħ ħ","- Ż ż"],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/malta/mt_language.webp","link":"","clues":["language"],"important":false,"tagged":false}]},{"title":"Regional clues","title_zh":"區域性線索","items":[{"id":"LOnP","text":["Regular metal guardrails are rare on Gozo Island. **Low stone barriers** are more common instead."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/malta/Gozo_Guardrails.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/xFtiRDcMLwNwoRvu6","clues":["guardrails"],"important":false,"tagged":true},{"id":"rb2X","text":["Uniquely, all bus routes on Gozo Island are in the **300s**. These can be quite hard to see, meaning they are most useful in moving games."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/malta/Gozo_Bus_Stop.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/2F963MPw76pBqYAt7","clues":[],"important":false,"tagged":false}]},{"title":"Spotlight","title_zh":"重點地標","items":[{"id":"CXV5","text":["These **blue signs** are unique to Valletta."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/malta/Valletta_Blue_Signs.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/VRkErHz2kwSuYg1R8","clues":["signs"],"important":false,"tagged":false},{"id":"aUAp","text":["This trekker on a ship that is painted **white and blue** can be seen between the main island and Gozo Island."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/malta/Boat.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/ndhsLqocWaJuh8Si7","clues":["google_vehicles"],"important":false,"tagged":false}]}],"tip_count":15,"facts":{"driving_side":"left","phone_numbers":"+356","domains":[".eu"],"currencies":[{"name":"Euro","symbol":"€","status":"official","code":"EUR"}],"years":["2016","2018","2019","2020","2021","2022","2024","2025"],"lines":[["white"],["white"],["white"]]},"gallery":{"architecture":[{"image":"geohints/architecture/malta_1.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/irJpBwDx81aAbAp58"}],"bollards":[{"image":"geohints/bollards/bollard_697.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/WyMHEjuDw1MCiiMZ6"}],"companies":[{"image":"geohints/companies/companies_66.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/Yq9hPRQ5MiUZkqiaA"},{"image":"geohints/companies/companies_1176.svg","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/NrFRmevSuMnRvRFT6"}],"gas_stations":[{"image":"geohints/companies/companies_408.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/bt4qQic171qm2Jb3A"}],"flags":[{"image":"geohints/flags/flags_72.svg","link":""}],"google_vehicles":[{"image":"geohints/googleVehicles/boat_86.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/1f7YDenLHXZp